  "method": "PINGYOU NEW PHYSICAL CONSTRUCTIONS \u2014 BATCH050\n\nExactly32 fresh occupied-record improvements. The complete finite packings use fixed declared frames, explicit lattice-source windows, physical boundary marks, complete-owner deletion and continued pair-port returns, or whole-prism modules and their rows/layers, as declared separately in each witness. Every inherited mark, parent/deletion word, frame, pair separator and one common host scale remains explicit. No arbitrary angle search is used.\n\nEach selected version passes independent source and full physical-decoder review, native interval containment for every vertex and complete native pair separation. Whole-parent deletion is checked before subsequent returns. Neutral fixed-map states, where present, remain complete geometries, with convex interpolation preserving all selected linear walls and separators. Prism compositions retain every module/strip end cost and common layer boundary.\n\nEach selected native scale lies below all pinned current native, nominal and reference baselines, including community records. Complete public-native comparisons prove changed geometry by centered-radius or full pair-distance spectra. All32 cases are distinct from every earlier frozen batch. Equal-value, stronger replacement and nonrecord predecessor geometries remain retained separately.\n\nClassical lattices, triangular tiling, Cartesian products, cube symmetries and published source authors retain attribution in each native witness. Finite assembly credit is exactly PingYou Ltd. Exact ideal endpoints, when present, are stated and proved only in their separate theorem companions. Other native improvements carry no global optimum claim. No invention of those classical source operations is claimed.\n\nOwnership classification at 2026-10-15 10:29: 32 previously unheld selected cases and 0 self-improvements. This describes the baseline, not acceptance of this archive.\n\nArchive SHA256: df46599b46dec6b0f5f8fe9076